sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant Router as Router
    participant Parameters as Parameters
    participant Middleware as Middleware
    participant Controller as Controller
    participant Service as Service
    participant DAO as DAO
    participant Database as Database
    participant View as View
    
    User->>Browser: Clica "Ver Perfil"
    Browser->>Router: GET /profile/123
    
    Note over Router: 1. Análise da requisição
    Router->>Router: Routes::getRouter
    Router->>Router: Request::getMethod retorna "get"
    Router->>Router: getCleanUri retorna "/profile/123"
    
    Note over Router: 2. Busca da rota
    Router->>Router: processAllRoutes
    Router->>Router: matchRoute para "/{user_id}" retorna true
    Router-->>Router: ProfileController@show encontrado
    
    Note over Router: 3. Aplicação de middleware
    Router->>Middleware: applyMiddlewares com auth
    Middleware->>Middleware: checkAuth
    Middleware-->>Router: Sessão válida
    
    Note over Router: 4. Extração de parâmetros
    Router->>Parameters: getRouterParams para "ProfileController@show"
    Parameters->>Router: extractRouteParams com "/profile/{user_id}" e "/profile/123"
    Parameters-->>Router: Array com "123"
    
    Note over Router: 5. Execução do controller
    Router->>Controller: Controller::execute com "ProfileController@show"
    Controller->>Controller: new ProfileController
    Controller->>Controller: método show com parâmetro 123
    
    Note over Controller: 6. Processamento da lógica
    Controller->>Service: getProfileData com 123
    Service->>DAO: getUserById com 123
    DAO->>Database: SELECT FROM users WHERE id=123
    Database-->>DAO: User data
    DAO-->>Service: User object
    Service-->>Controller: Profile data
    
    Note over Controller: 7. Renderização da view
    Controller->>View: view com template profile e viewData
    View->>View: View::render com template profile e data
    View-->>Controller: HTML content
    Controller-->>Browser: HTTP Response
    Browser-->>User: Página do perfil exibida